      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners express deep appreciation for Dr. Henry, Dr. Feng, and the veterinary support staff. Reviewers consistently highlight their empathy, thorough examinations, and comforting presence during critical medical visits. While a single client felt turned away when presenting an exotic pet, the vast majority describe the team as exceptionally attentive."
