      "title": {
        "en": "Specialized care for delicate dog breeds"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many clients specifically seek out Suburbia North for its expertise in handling French Bulldogs, English Bulldogs, and Cavalier King Charles Spaniels. Owners travel substantial distances knowing their brachycephalic dogs receive attentive breed-specific care. The clinic is also widely recognized for its canine reproduction and breeding assistance."
      }
    },
    {
